      grammarNote: "-이/가 아니라 表示\"不是……而是……\"，前面接名词，否定前一身份的同时肯定后一身份。~이자 表示\"既是……又是……\"，连接两个对等的名词属性。两者叠加使用表达了韩剧身份的转变以及随之而来的双重属性。", grammarNoteEn: '\'-이/가 아니라\' means \'not... but rather...\' and follows a noun, negating the previous identity while affirming the next. \'~이자\' means \'both... and...\' and connects two equal noun attributes. Used together, they express the shift in K-dramas\' identity and its resulting dual nature.',
