    keySentence: {
      ko: "돌아오는 길, 한 사회학과 교수는 \"정치권이 갈등을 소비만 할 게 아니라 제도로 풀어야 한다\"고 했다.",
      zh: "回来的路上，一位社会学教授说：\"政界不该一味消费矛盾，而应该用制度来解决。\"", zhEn: 'On the way back, a sociology professor said, "Politics shouldn\'t just exploit conflicts but should resolve them through institutions."',
      grammarNote: "-만 할 게 아니라 是C1级复合句型，表示\"不应该仅仅……而应该……\"。先通过-만限定被否定的行为范围（소비만=仅仅消费），再用-이 아니라否定该限定并引出替代方案（제도로 풀다=用制度解决）。句中嵌套直接引语，形成\"叙述者引述权威观点\"的复合层次，常见于社论和深度报道。", grammarNoteEn: '-만 할 게 아니라 is a C1-level compound pattern meaning "shouldn\'t just... but should...". It first uses -만 to limit the scope of the negated action (소비만 = just consuming), then uses -이 아니라 to negate that limit and introduce an alternative (제도로 풀다 = solve through institutions). The sentence embeds a direct quote, creating a layered structure where the narrator cites an authoritative view, common in editorials and in-depth reports.',
    },
