        zh: "切胡萝卜丝、摊鸡蛋薄饼的指尖动作，与五十年前在釜山水晶洞巷子里从母亲那里学来的一模一样，静止在时间里。", zhEn: 'The finger movements of shredding carrots and spreading thin egg pancakes are identical to what she learned from her mother in the alleys of Busan\'s Sujeong-dong fifty years ago, frozen in time.',
        pronunciation: "",
        words: [{ word: "채 치다", meaning: "切丝", meaningEn: 'Shredding' }, { word: "지단", meaning: "薄蛋饼", meaningEn: 'Thin egg pancake' }],
        grammarIds: [],
