        zh: "玄关门开了，二十岁的孙子杰森一边脱运动鞋，一边喊了一声\"Grandma！\"。", zhEn: 'The front door opens, and twenty-year-old grandson Jason calls out "Grandma!" as he kicks off his sneakers.',
