        zh: "金女士用韩语问\"吃饭了吗\"，杰森迟疑片刻，回了一声\"Yes\"。", zhEn: 'Ms. Kim asked in Korean, "Have you eaten?" Jason hesitated for a moment, then replied with a "Yes."',
