        zh: "金女士跟随丈夫踏上洛杉矶的土地，是1973年——双手抱着八个月大的大儿子，背上驮着婆婆织的一只棉布包袱。", zhEn: 'Ms. Kim set foot on Los Angeles soil with her husband in 1973—holding her eight-month-old eldest son in her arms, with a cotton bundle knitted by her mother-in-law strapped to her back.',
        pronunciation: "",
