        zh: "二十岁抵达的美国，四十岁开的洗衣店，五十岁握在手中的公民证——金女士的人生不是用数字，而是用漂白剂、食用油和教会泡沫塑料咖啡杯的气味编纂而成。", zhEn: 'The America she arrived in at twenty, the laundromat she opened at forty, the citizenship certificate in her hand at fifty—Ms. Kim\'s life was not chronicled in numbers, but in the smells of bleach, cooking oil, and church Styrofoam coffee cups.',
        pronunciation: "",
