        zh: "这场沉默并非洛杉矶独有的风景——在圣保罗Bom Retiro的韩人敬老院，在阿拉木图高丽剧院的后巷，在柏林韩餐厅狭窄的厨房，同样的沉默于每周日在不同纬度同时降临。", zhEn: 'This silence is not unique to Los Angeles—in the Korean senior home in Bom Retiro, São Paulo, in the back alleys of the Goryeo Theater in Almaty, in the cramped kitchens of Korean restaurants in Berlin, the same silence descends simultaneously at different latitudes every Sunday.',
