        zh: "韩裔美国二代作家李敏金坦言，通过母亲的英语发音和祖母大酱汤的气味，她所不会说的韩语，在自己浑然不觉中渗入了身体。", zhEn: 'Korean-American second-generation writer Lee Min-jin admits that through her mother\'s English pronunciation and her grandmother\'s soybean paste stew, the Korean she couldn\'t speak seeped into her body without her even realizing it.',
