        zh: "站在边界上，既是一种无法彻底归属于任何一个世界的剥夺感，同时也是用两副镜片立体地凝视这个世界的能力。", zhEn: 'Standing on the boundary is both a sense of deprivation—of never fully belonging to either world—and the ability to gaze at this world stereoscopically through two lenses.',
        pronunciation: "",
