        zh: "韩裔美国诗人Cathy Park Hong以\"我的韩语是不完整句子的墓园\"一语凝缩了双语者的处境，而评论界指出，恰恰是那种不完整性构成了她诗歌的核心驱动力。", zhEn: 'Korean American poet Cathy Park Hong condensed the bilingual\'s predicament with the phrase "my Korean is a graveyard of incomplete sentences," and critics have noted that it is precisely that incompleteness that forms the core driving force of her poetry.',
        pronunciation: "",
