        zh: "周日傍晚，金玉顺坐在空荡荡的紫菜包饭盘子前，将剩下的一张紫菜放入口中久久咀嚼——脆脆的声响越过玄关门，缓缓消散。", zhEn: 'On Sunday evening, Kim Ok-soon sat before an empty gimbap plate, placing the last sheet of seaweed in her mouth and chewing for a long time—the crisp sound drifted past the front door and slowly faded away.',
        pronunciation: "",
