        zh: "朝鲜时代以汉字为中心的书面语传统，作为压制语言变化方向数百年的机制而运作。", zhEn: 'The Joseon-era written tradition centered on Chinese characters operated as a mechanism that suppressed the direction of language change for centuries.',
