        zh: "院子正中央，家人们正忙着准备中秋茶礼桌。二十四只木制祭器整整齐齐地摆着，板栗、大枣、柿饼、梨子一一盛入每只碟中。", zhEn: 'In the center of the courtyard, family members were busy preparing the Chuseok memorial table. Twenty-four wooden ritual vessels were neatly arranged, with chestnuts, jujubes, dried persimmons, and pears placed one by one into each dish.',
