        zh: "70多岁的宗妇正指挥着食物的摆放。\"红果东边、白果西边\"——\"红东白西\"的说法自然而然地从口中说出。", zhEn: 'The matriarch, in her 70s, was directing the food arrangement. "Red fruits east, white fruits west"—the rule of "red east, white west" came out of her mouth naturally.',
        pronunciation: "70dae jongbuga eumsik baechireul jindujihwihaetda. bulgeun gwaireun dongjjok, huin gwaireun seojjoge nonneundaneun 'hongdongbaekseo'ga jayeonseureopge ibeseo nawatda.",
        words: [{ word: "종부", meaning: "宗妇、长房嫡媳", meaningEn: 'matriarch (eldest grandson\'s wife)' }, { word: "홍동백서", meaning: "红东白西（祭祀摆放原则）", meaningEn: 'red east, white west (ritual placement rule)' }],
