        zh: "按栗、枣、柿、梨顺序陈设的\"枣栗柿梨\"原则也照做了。据说这是500年前退溪李滉整理了安东地区的礼法以来绵延不绝的方式。", zhEn: 'The "jujube, chestnut, persimmon, pear" rule, arranging foods in that order, was also followed. It\'s said this practice has continued unbroken since Toegye Yi Hwang codified the rites of the Andong region 500 years ago.',
        pronunciation: "bam·daechu·gam·bae sunseoro jinseolhaneun 'joyulsii' wonchikdo ttaratda. 500nyeon jeon toegye ihwangi andong jiyeok yebeobeul jeongrihan irae myeonmyeonhi ieojin bangsigirago handa.",
