        zh: "女人们止步于从厨房端送食物。她们并不直接参与祭祀。对这明显的性别分工，内心不免吃了一惊。", zhEn: 'The women\'s role stopped at bringing food from the kitchen. They didn\'t directly take part in the rite. I couldn\'t help being startled by this clear gender division.',
