        zh: "贯穿朝鲜时代的儒教秩序，就这样以父系血统和男性中心礼法具体化了。从1392年到1910年的518年间，国家理念就是性理学。", zhEn: 'The Confucian order that ran through the Joseon Dynasty was thus embodied in patrilineal bloodlines and male-centered rites. For 518 years, from 1392 to 1910, the state ideology was Neo-Confucianism.',
