        zh: "在儒教核心德目三纲五伦中，孝是一切道德的出发点。其逻辑是对父母的孝扩展为对君主的忠。", zhEn: 'Among the Three Bonds and Five Relationships, the core virtues of Confucianism, filial piety was the starting point of all morality. The logic was that filial piety toward parents extended into loyalty toward the king.',
        pronunciation: "yugyoui haeksim deongmogin samgangoryun gaundeseodo hyo(孝)ga modeun dodeogui chulbaljeomieotda. bumoe daehan hyoga imgeume daehan chung(忠)euro hwakjangdoendaneun nolliyeotda.",
        words: [{ word: "삼강오륜", meaning: "三纲五伦", meaningEn: 'Three Bonds and Five Relationships' }, { word: "효", meaning: "孝", meaningEn: 'filial piety' }],
