        zh: "祭祀文化是将这种孝观念最戏剧性地展现出来的现场。向逝去祖先献上食物并行礼的行为中，渗透着一股不肯切断世代之间联系的执拗意志。", zhEn: 'Ancestral rites are where this notion of filial piety is most dramatically displayed. In the act of offering food and bowing to deceased ancestors runs a stubborn will to never sever the ties between generations.',
        pronunciation: "jesa munhwaneun i hyo gwannyeomeul gajang geukjeogeuro boyeo juneun hyeonjangida. jugeun josangege eumsigeul olrigo jeolhaneun haengwieneun, sedae gan yeongyeoreul kkeunji anheuryeoneun jibyohan uijiga baeeo itda.",
