        zh: "在安东见到的一位国学者这样解释：\"儒教之所以支撑了朝鲜500年，不是因为是思想，而是因为是生活规范。\"冠婚丧祭悉数与儒教礼法相一致。", zhEn: 'A Korean classical scholar I met in Andong explained it this way: "Confucianism sustained Joseon for 500 years not because it was a philosophy, but because it was a code of daily life." Coming-of-age ceremonies, weddings, funerals, and ancestral rites all follow Confucian protocol.',
        pronunciation: "andongeseo mannan han gukakjaneun ireoke seolmyeonghaetda. \"yugyoga joseon 500nyeoneul jitaenghan geon, sasangiraseoga anira saenghwal gyubeomieotgi ttaemunimnida.\" gwanhonsangje modu yugyo yebeobe matchwojyeo isseotda.",
