        zh: "这种生活规范也深嵌在现代韩语中。根据年龄和地位变换语尾的整个敬语体系，是儒教等级意识的语言遗迹。", zhEn: 'This code of daily life is also deeply embedded in modern Korean. The entire honorific system, which shifts verb endings based on age and status, is a linguistic remnant of Confucian hierarchy.',
