        zh: "在公司连对早一年入职的前辈都要用敬语的文化，对外人来说很陌生。但韩国人自己却觉得那很自然——儒教的无意识浸入身体，支配着语言。", zhEn: 'The culture of using honorifics even with a colleague who joined just one year earlier feels foreign to outsiders. But Koreans themselves find it perfectly natural—Confucianism has seeped into their bones unconsciously and governs their language.',
