        zh: "2024年韩国的私教育费总额超过了27万亿韩元。五千万国民一年的私教育支出比某些国家的国防预算还多。这一现象很难说与儒教无关。", zhEn: 'In 2024, South Korea\'s total private education spending exceeded 27 trillion won. The annual private tutoring expenditure of 50 million people is larger than some countries\' defense budgets. It\'s hard to say this phenomenon has nothing to do with Confucianism.',
