        zh: "茶礼结束后，我与宗孙一边喝烧酒一边聊了各种话题。\"现在的年轻人，祭祀也好节日也好都不像从前了。\"宗孙的话里混着无奈。", zhEn: 'After the tea ceremony, I chatted with the eldest grandson over some soju. "Young people these days—whether it\'s ancestral rites or holidays, nothing\'s like it used to be," he said, a hint of resignation in his voice.',
