        zh: "但也不能说儒教正在简单消亡。只是形式变了——年功序列和家门中心的思维，仍然深刻地介入韩国人的决策过程。", zhEn: 'But it\'s not like Confucianism is simply dying out. The forms have changed—yet seniority-based hierarchy and family-centric thinking still deeply shape Koreans\' decision-making.',
