        zh: "这个问题里完好地承载着韩国社会围绕儒教传统的现在进行时紧张。想要守护传统的世代和想要摆脱传统的世代，在同一个屋檐下共存的国度。", zhEn: 'That question perfectly captures the ongoing tension in Korean society over Confucian tradition—a country where the generation that wants to preserve tradition and the one that wants to break free coexist under the same roof.',
        pronunciation: "i jilmuneneun yugyo jeontongeul dulreossan hanguk sahoeui hyeonjaehyeong ginjangi goseuranhi damgyeo isseotda. jeontongeul jikiryeoneun sedaewa beoseonaryeoneun sedaega gateun jibung arae gongjonhaneun narada.",
