        zh: "但并非说起来那么容易。数百年层层累积的儒教无意识，不是改变法律或制度就能在朝夕间消失的——只看一个敬语法就能明白。", zhEn: 'But it\'s easier said than done. Centuries of layered Confucian unconsciousness won\'t vanish overnight just by changing laws or institutions—just look at the honorific system.',
        pronunciation: "malcheoreom swiun ireun anida. subaek nyeon kyeokyeoi ssahin yugyojeok muuisigeun beobina jedoreul bakkundago haruachime sarajiji anneunda. gyeongeobeop hanaman bwado al su itda.",
        words: [{ word: "켜켜이", meaning: "层层地", meaningEn: 'Layer by layer' }, { word: "하루아침", meaning: "朝夕、一夜之间", meaningEn: 'Overnight' }],
        grammarIds: [],
        difficulty: "hard",
