  questions: [
    { id: 'q1', type: 'detail', prompt: '主角在市政厅地下密室里发现的名单，以及夹在末尾的那份文件，说明了什么？', promptEn: 'What does the list the protagonist found in the underground secret room of City Hall, along with the document tucked at the end, reveal?', options: ['一份新居民的欢迎名单', '有人在批准并决定谁能留下、谁被悄悄清理，且文件上有市长的签名', '市长的私人通讯录', '一份普通的城市人口统计'], answer: 1, explanation: '名字旁盖着"迁出""清理""除外"的印章，名单末尾夹着一份"批准以上全部"的文件，下方留着市长的签名，说明有人在单方面决定动物城居民的去留。', explanationEn: 'Next to the names are stamps reading "Relocated," "Cleared," and "Excluded," and at the end of the list is a document approving all of the above, signed by the mayor—showing someone is unilaterally deciding who stays and who goes in Animal City.' },
    { id: 'q2', type: 'main_idea', prompt: '这个故事想传达的感觉最接近哪一个？', promptEn: 'Which feeling does this story aim to convey most closely?', options: ['对城市高效治理的赞美', '完美城市的背后，是由权力单方面决定他人存在与去留的残忍代价，而这权力似乎还有更深的源头', '一场紧张刺激的寻宝冒险', '公务员加班工作的写实记录'], answer: 1, explanation: '故事揭示"完美"以有人被权力抹去存在为代价，结尾暗示连市长都在服从更高的命令，把矛头引向"最尽头站着谁"，带出沉重的道德不安并引向结局。', explanationEn: 'The story reveals that "perfection" comes at the cost of people being erased by power, and the ending hints that even the mayor answers to a higher command, pointing to "who stands at the very top," bringing heavy moral unease and leading to the conclusion.' },
  ],
  audioUrl: '/audio/reading/story-forbidden-mayor-secret.mp3',
